000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     CEAUPEMP.
      *VERSION.        CEAUPEMPV02.
000400 AUTHOR.         C HILLES/J COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   9/2/87.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
      ******************************************************************
001000*   ELECTRONIC REQUISITION APPROVALS - UPDATE 'MPATH' & 'MLEVEL' *
001100*   DATASETS WHEN AN EMPLOYEE'S LEVEL OR ACTIVE STATE CHANGES.   *
      *                                                                *
      *   CALLED BY PROGRAMS: SEASETUS                                 *
      *                       SEAVACA                                  *
      *                       SMREQINQ                                 *
      ******************************************************************
      * CHANGES, MODIFICATIONS AND ENHANCEMENTS:
      *C   MARCH 1995 JE COFFMAN
      *C   ADDED THE CAPABILITY TO LOOK AT A POSSIBLE 999 PATHS IF THE
      *C   EMPLOYEE THAT IS AUTHORIZED AT A SPECIFIC LEVEL CHANGES. OLD
      *C   LOGIC ONLY WENT UNTIL THERE WAS A BREAK IN THE PATH NUMBERS.
      *C   I CHANGED THE LOGIC AFTER LAWTON NOTED EXCESSIVE WAIT TIME
      *C   TO ALSO EXIT 7100-UPDATE-PATHS LOGIC TO BACK OUT IF 2
      *C   SUCCESSIVE EMPTY PATHS WERE ENCOUNTERED. THIS CAN BE CHANGED
      *C   TO A HIGHER NUMBER SIMPLY BY ALLOWING THE BLANK-PATHS-CTR
      *C   TO ATTAIN A HIGHER VALUE.
      *C
      *C  11/11/2004  B FONAGY   VER. - CEAUPEMPV02
      *C  ****** RED BALL REQUEST SYSTEM # 2004-55492
      *C       MODIFY LOGIC TO READ SEQUENTIALLY THROUGH
      *C       'MPATH' INSTEAD OF DIRECT READ.  THE PREVIOUS
      *C       LOGIC ONLY ALLOWED FOR 11 'GAPS' BETWEEN
      *C       ACUTAL PATH NUMBERS.  NOT ALL PATHS WERE
      *C       GETTING UPDATED BECAUSE OF THIS.
      *C

001400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPATH
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MLEVEL
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MEMPL
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

001800
001900 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPATH
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPATH-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3900  OF MCFLCS3901.

       FD  MLEVEL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MLEVEL-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS4100  OF MCFLCS4101.

       FD  MEMPL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MEMPL-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS4200  OF MCFLCS4201.

002000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002100 77  BLANK-PATHS-CTR               PIC 99.
002200 77  EMPL-MATCHED-FLAG             PIC X(1).
002300 77  SUB                           PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
002400
002500**************************************************************
002600**                                                          **
002700**            D A T A B A S E   W O R K                     **
002800**                                                          **
002900**************************************************************
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
003000
003100 01  DSET-NAMES.
003200     05  DSET-NAME                 PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
003300     05  DSET-MPATH                PIC X(16) VALUE "MPATH;".
003400     05  DSET-MLEVEL               PIC X(16) VALUE "MLEVEL;".
003500     05  DSET-MEMPL                PIC X(16) VALUE "MEMPL;".
003600
003700 01  MODE-AREA.
003800     05  DB-MODE                   PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 0.
003900     05  MODE1                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 1.
004000     05  MODE2                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 2.
004100     05  MODE3                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 3.
004200     05  MODE5                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 5.
004300     05  MODE7                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 7.
004400
004500 01  ALL-ITEMS                     PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
004600 01  LEVEL-ARG                     PIC X(2).
      ****************************************
      *        VER. CEAUPEMPV02              *
      ****************************************
       01  PATH-ARG                      PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
004700* 01  PATH-ARG.
004800*     05  PATH-ARG-PREFIX           PIC X(1)  VALUE "R".
004900*     05  PATH-ARG-NUMBER           PIC 9(3).
005000 01  EMPL-ARG                      PIC X(4).
005100
005200*01  MULTI-LOCK.
005300*    05  NUMBER-OF-DSETS-LOCKED PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 1.
005400*    05  LOCK1.
005500*        10  LENGTH-1           PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 24.
005600*        10  DSET-NAME-1        PIC X(16)  VALUE "MEMPL;".
005700*        10  ITEM-LIST-1        PIC X(16)  VALUE "EMPLOYEE-ID;".
005800*        10  REL-OP-1           PIC XX     VALUE "= ".
005900*        10  LOCK-VALUE-1       PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
006000*
006100**************************************************************
006200**                                                          **
006300**           D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                **
006400**                                                          **
006500**************************************************************
006600
006700 COPY MPATH      IN COPYLIB.
006800 COPY MLEVEL     IN COPYLIB.
006900 COPY MEMPL      IN COPYLIB.
007000
007100**************************************************************
007200**                                                          **
007300**            L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N                 **
007400**                                                          **
007500**************************************************************
007600
007700 LINKAGE SECTION.
007800 01  BASE                          PIC X(10).
007900 COPY DBSTAT     IN COPYLIB.
008000 COPY CEAUPEMP   IN COPYLIB.
008100 01  BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
008200     05  BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1          PIC X(1).
008300     05  FILLER                    PIC X(59).
008400
008500 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING          BASE
008600                                   STATUS-AREA,
008700                                   CEAUPEMP-PARMS,
008800                                   BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
008900
009000 6000-UPDATE-ACTIVE.
              OPEN I-O MPATH, MLEVEL, MEMPL.
009100*------ WE HAVE TO DO 2 THINGS:
009200*------   1.  TAKE OUT OLD LEVEL (IF HE WAS ACTIVE AT THAT LEVEL)
009300*------   2.  ADD HIM TO NEW LEVEL (IF HE IS NOW ACTIVE)
009400*------
009500*------ TAKE OUT OF OLD LEVEL HAPPENS ONLY IF HE CHANGES LEVELS.
009600*------ IF SO, HERE ARE THE POSSIBILITIES:
009700*------   1.  WAS NOT ACTIVE IN OLD LEVEL: DO NOTHING
009800*------   2.  WAS ACTIVE IN OLD LEVEL:
009900*------         - UPDATE MLEVEL (OF OLD LEVEL)
010000*------         - UPDATE MPATH: TAKE EMPL OUT OF PATHS WITH OLD LV
010100*------
010200*------  ADDING HIM TO NEW LEVEL HAS THE FOLLOWING POSSIBILITES:
010300*------   1. NOW ACTIVE, WAS ACTIVE AT CURRENT LV: DO NOTHING
010400*------   2. NOW ACTIVE, WASNT ACTIVE AT CURRENT LV: ADD
010500*------   3. NOT NOW ACTIVE, WAS ACTIVE AT CUR LV: ERASE
010600*------   4. NOT NOW ACTIVE, WAS NOT ACTIVE AT CUR LV: DO NOTHING
010700
010800*------ IF HIS LEVEL HASNT CHANGED AND HIS ACTIVE STATE HASNT
010900*------ CHANGED, THERE IS NOTHING TO UPDATE.  NOTE: ON AN ADD,
011000*------ THE OLD FLDS ARE SPACED OUT SO CHANGE IS FORCED.
011100     IF CEAU-OLD-LEVEL = CEAU-CURRENT-LEVEL
011200       AND CEAU-OLD-ACTIVE = CEAU-CURRENT-ACTIVE
011300         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.
011400
011500*------ FIRST, GET THE EMPLS CURRENT LEVEL.  THIS MUST BE EDITED
011600*------ BY CALLING PGM.  IF NOT, LATER.
011700     MOVE CEAU-CURRENT-LEVEL       TO   LEVEL-ARG.
011800     PERFORM 7070-GET-MLEVEL.
011900     IF NO-ENTRY
012000         GO TO 6005-SKIP-LEVEL-UPDATE.
012100
012500*------ IF ACTIVE, ADD THE EMPL AS THE ACTIVE EMPL FOR THAT
012600*------ LEVEL.  NOTE: THE MLEVEL ENTRY WAS GOTTEN DURING THE
012700*------ EDITS.
012800*------   1 EMPL CAN HAVE MULTIPLE LEVELS (THRU ALTERNATE ASSIGN)
012900*------   1 LEVEL CAN HAVE MULTIPLE EMPLS (BUT ONLY 1 ACTIVE)
013000     IF CEAU-CURRENT-ACTIVE = "Y"
013100       IF CEAU-EMPL NOT = MLEVEL-ACTIVE-EMPL
013200         MOVE CEAU-EMPL           TO   MLEVEL-ACTIVE-EMPL.
013300
013400*------ IF WENT FROM ACTIVE TO INACTIVE AT CURRENT LEVEL, DELETE
013500*------ AS ACTIVE EMPL FOR THAT LEVEL.
013600     IF CEAU-CURRENT-ACTIVE = "N"
013700         IF CEAU-EMPL = MLEVEL-ACTIVE-EMPL
013800             MOVE SPACES           TO   MLEVEL-ACTIVE-EMPL.
013900
014000     PERFORM 7060-UPDATE-MLEVEL.
014200
014300 6005-SKIP-LEVEL-UPDATE.
014400*------ IF CALLING PROG REQUESTED TO UPDATE ACTIVE STATE IN THE
014500*------ MEMPL DATASET, DO SO.
014600     IF CEAU-UPDATE-MEMPL-FLAG = "Y"
014700         PERFORM 7000-UPDATE-MEMPL.
014800
014900*------ IF HE WAS ACTIVE AT OLD LEVEL, AND LEVEL CHANGED, DELETE
015000*------ HIM AS THE ACTIVE EMPL FROM THE OLD LEVEL.
015100     IF CEAU-OLD-ACTIVE = "Y"
015200       AND (CEAU-OLD-LEVEL NOT = CEAU-CURRENT-LEVEL)
015300         MOVE CEAU-OLD-LEVEL            TO   LEVEL-ARG
015400         PERFORM 7070-GET-MLEVEL
015500         IF GOOD-CALL AND MLEVEL-ACTIVE-EMPL = CEAU-EMPL
015600             MOVE SPACES           TO   MLEVEL-ACTIVE-EMPL
015700             MOVE "MLEVEL;"        TO   DSET-NAME
015900             PERFORM 7060-UPDATE-MLEVEL
               ELSE
                   MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO LEVELNUM OF MLEVEL-REC
                   START MLEVEL KEY > LEVELNUM OF MLEVEL-REC
                       INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.
016100
016200*------ NOW, GO THRU EACH PATH AND UPDATE THIS LEVEL
016300*------ FOR THE CORRECT ACTIVE EMPL.  DO FOR BOTH 'R' AND 'A'
016400*------ PATHS.
      ****************************************
      *         VER. CEAUPEMPV02             *
      ****************************************
016500*     MOVE "A"                      TO   PATH-ARG-PREFIX.
016600*     PERFORM 7100-UPDATE-PATHS THRU 7190-UP-X.
016700*     MOVE "R"                      TO   PATH-ARG-PREFIX.
016800     PERFORM 7100-UPDATE-PATHS THRU 7190-UP-X.
016900
017000 6990-MAIN-X.
           CLOSE MPATH, MLEVEL, MEMPL.
017100     GOBACK.
017200
017300******************************************************************
017400**                                                              **
017500**    P E R F O R M E D   R O U T I N E S                       **
017600**                                                              **
017700******************************************************************
017800
017900 7000-UPDATE-MEMPL.
018200     MOVE CEAU-EMPL                TO   EMPL-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE EMPL-ARG TO EMPLOYID OF MEMPL-REC.
           READ MEMPL INTO BUF-MEMPL
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
019100     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
019200         MOVE "DBGET ERR MEMPL 6100-I" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
019300         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.
019400
019500     MOVE CEAU-CURRENT-ACTIVE      TO   MEMPL-ACTIVE-FLAG.
019600
019700*    CALL "DBUPDATE" USING BASE, DSET-MEMPL, MODE1, STATUS-AREA,
019800*      ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MEMPL.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           REWRITE MEMPL-REC FROM BUF-MEMPL
               INVALID KEY MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
019900     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
020000         MOVE "DBUPDATE ERR MEMPL 6100-I" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
020100         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.
020200
022100 7060-UPDATE-MLEVEL.
022200*    CALL "DBUPDATE" USING BASE, DSET-MLEVEL, MODE1,
022300*      STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MLEVEL.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           REWRITE MLEVEL-REC FROM BUF-MLEVEL
               INVALID KEY MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
022400     IF NO-ENTRY
022500         NEXT SENTENCE
022600     ELSE
022700     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
022800         MOVE "CEAUPEMP DBUPDATE ERR 7060-UM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
022900         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.
023000
023100 7070-GET-MLEVEL.
023200*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MLEVEL, MODE7,
023300*      STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MLEVEL, LEVEL-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE LEVEL-ARG TO LEVELNUM OF MLEVEL-REC.
           READ MLEVEL INTO BUF-MLEVEL
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
023400     IF NO-ENTRY
023500         NEXT SENTENCE
023600     ELSE
023700     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
023800         MOVE "CEAUPEMP DBGET ERR MLEVEL 7070-GM"
023900                                   TO   BU-DISPLAY-MSG
024000         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.
024100
      ***************************************
      *        VER. CEAUPEMPV02             *
      ***************************************
024200 7100-UPDATE-PATHS.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO PATHNUM OF MPATH-REC.
           START MPATH KEY > PATHNUM
               INVALID KEY MOVE 11 TO COND-WORD.
024300*     MOVE 0                        TO   PATH-ARG-NUMBER,
      *                                        BLANK-PATHS-CTR.

024400 7110-PATH-LOOP.
024500*     ADD 1                         TO   PATH-ARG-NUMBER.
024600
024700*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MPATH, MODE7, STATUS-AREA,
024800*      ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPATH, PATH-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ MPATH NEXT INTO BUF-MPATH
               AT END MOVE 11 TO COND-WORD.
      *     MOVE PATH-ARG TO PATHNUM OF MPATH-REC.
      *     READ MPATH INTO BUF-MPATH
      *         INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
      *     IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      *         MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
      *         ADD 1   TO BLANK-PATHS-CTR
      *     ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 11 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               END-IF
           END-IF.
024900*     IF NO-ENTRY
      *    UPDATED TO PERMIT 12 BLANK PATHS BEFOURE DEFAULT
      *    PATH IS CHOSEN DUE TO U.C. REORG PATH PROBLEM...JEC
      *         IF BLANK-PATHS-CTR > 11
      *             GO TO 7190-UP-X
      *         ELSE
      *         IF PATH-ARG-NUMBER = 999
      *             GO TO 7190-UP-X
      *         ELSE
025000*         GO TO 7110-PATH-LOOP
           IF END-OF-FILE
               GO TO 7190-UP-X
025100     ELSE
025200     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
025300         MOVE "CEAUPEMP DBGET ERR MPTH 6000-M" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 7190-UP-X.
           IF MPATH-PATH-NUMBER = SPACES
               GO TO 7110-PATH-LOOP
           END-IF.
025500
      *     MOVE 0                        TO   BLANK-PATHS-CTR.
025600     PERFORM 8100-CHECK-EMPL THRU 8190-CE-X.
025700     IF EMPL-MATCHED-FLAG = "Y"
025800         MOVE "MPATH;"             TO   DSET-NAME
025900*        PERFORM 7040-LOCK-SET
026000*        CALL "DBUPDATE" USING BASE, DSET-MPATH, MODE1,
026100*          STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPATH
               MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD
               REWRITE MPATH-REC FROM BUF-MPATH
                   INVALID KEY MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               END-IF
026200         IF NOT GOOD-CALL
026300             MOVE "CEAUPEMP DBUPDATE ERR MPATH 6010-PL"
026400                                   TO   BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 7190-UP-X
026600         ELSE
026700             NEXT SENTENCE.
      *     ELSE
      *         MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PATHNUM OF MPATH-REC
      *         START MPATH KEY > PATHNUM OF MPATH-REC
      *             INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.
026800
026900     GO TO 7110-PATH-LOOP.
027000
027100 7190-UP-X.
027200     EXIT.
027300
027400
027500
027600 8100-CHECK-EMPL.
027700     MOVE 0                        TO   SUB.
027800     MOVE "N"                      TO   EMPL-MATCHED-FLAG.
027900
028000 8110-CHECK-EMPL-LOOP.
028100     ADD 1                         TO   SUB.
028200     IF SUB > 12
028300         GO TO 8190-CE-X.
028400
028500*------ ADD TO NEW LEVEL IF NEEDED
028600     IF CEAU-CURRENT-ACTIVE = "Y"
028700       IF CEAU-CURRENT-LEVEL = MPATH-LEVEL (SUB)
028800         IF CEAU-EMPL NOT = MPATH-EMPL (SUB)
028900             MOVE "Y"              TO   EMPL-MATCHED-FLAG
029000             MOVE CEAU-EMPL        TO   MPATH-EMPL (SUB).
029100
029200*------ DELETE FROM OLD LEVEL IF NEEDED
029300     IF CEAU-OLD-LEVEL = CEAU-CURRENT-LEVEL
029400         NEXT SENTENCE
029500     ELSE
029600     IF CEAU-OLD-ACTIVE = "N"
029700         NEXT SENTENCE
029800     ELSE
029900     IF CEAU-OLD-LEVEL = MPATH-LEVEL (SUB)
030000         MOVE "Y"                  TO   EMPL-MATCHED-FLAG
030100         MOVE SPACES               TO   MPATH-EMPL (SUB).
030200
030300*------ DELETE FROM OLD LEVEL IF HE WENT INACTIVE
030400     IF CEAU-CURRENT-ACTIVE = "N"
030500       IF CEAU-EMPL = MPATH-EMPL (SUB)
030600         IF CEAU-OLD-LEVEL = MPATH-LEVEL (SUB)
030700             MOVE "Y"              TO   EMPL-MATCHED-FLAG
030800             MOVE SPACES           TO   MPATH-EMPL (SUB).
030900
031000     GO TO 8110-CHECK-EMPL-LOOP.
031100
031200 8190-CE-X.
031300     EXIT.
